# Submodules. Reusing_scanner builds from its own directory as context, so
# nothing here ever needs it. Reusing-unibench_build's Dockerfiles do run
# with this repo as their context (that is why their COPY paths carry the
# Reusing-unibench_build/ prefix), but only for a handful of patches and
# data files -- everything else is experiment output, gigabytes of it.
Reusing_scanner/
Reusing-unibench_build/
!Reusing-unibench_build/aflplusplus/
!Reusing-unibench_build/aflplusplus-cmplog/
!Reusing-unibench_build/aflplusplus-reusing-target/
!Reusing-unibench_build/aflplusplus-reusing_fuzzer_only/
!Reusing-unibench_build/reusing-scanner-target/
!Reusing-unibench_build/forkserver_libafl/
!Reusing-unibench_build/forkserver_storfuzz/
!Reusing-unibench_build/coverage/
!Reusing-unibench_build/ffmpeg/
!Reusing-unibench_build/tools/volume/seeds/
